# Exact read inputs for the recursive odoo/ source audit (Xcode grants literal paths).
# Keep every file AND directory, including resources; do not limit to Swift files.
# On source additions/removals, update this list and run:
# python3 -B -m unittest discover -s scripts/tests -p test_audit_test_hook_naming.py -v
# The maintenance test compares the whole tree. The audit still recursively scans
# odoo/ (not this list), so an undeclared new file/directory fails closed in sandbox.
